# ========================================================================
# Ghorob Chams Residence (إقامة غروب شمس) - Environment Variables
# ========================================================================
# All environment variables in this project are OPTIONAL with safe defaults.
# The application runs fully functional at zero cost without requiring any external services.
# When deploying to an external host (e.g. Render, Railway, VPS), you can optionally set:
#
# PORT=3000
# NODE_ENV=production
# APP_URL=https://ghorob-chams-residence.ma
#
# Database (leave empty or unset to use the built-in zero-cost local storage):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@hostname:5432/dbname?sslmode=require
#
# Admin Credentials & Secret Key (for the Owner Portal at /admin):
# ADMIN_USERNAME=your_username
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_password
# ADMIN_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key
#
# Decoupled Frontend (leave unset if hosting frontend & backend together):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# CORS_ORIGIN=*
